                                                "text": "With the ability to network with like-minded young professionals from across the railway industry, while experiencing the history and culture of Japan and its railway network, YRTs first inter-continental tour can be deemed a great success!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df560cca-df1b-4986-9caf-b137a835c56c",
                                                "sense_id": "950ea4c1-574b-347e-98f4-36f796b80728",
                                                "text": "Even friends and advisers working with [Zohran] Mamdani’s campaign and like-minded allies on the city council, among the three dozen New York leaders who spoke with CNN, say privately that they fear Mamdani is behind in preparing for what’s ahead if he wins November’s election, as reliable public polls show he is in strong position to do."
